      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a different kind of rest\"... what does that even mean? it feels like no matter where i go or what i do, the paperwork and the debt and the nothingness just follow me. like i'm being erased in real time. if the machine doesn't see me, maybe i'm not even really here.",
